{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45628","headline":"拟齐梁体寄冯使君三首 三 · 贯休","name":"拟齐梁体寄冯使君三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大道贵无心，圣贤爲始慕。\n秋空共澄洁，美玉同贞素。\n伟哉桐江守，雌黄出金口。\n爲文能废兴，谈道弭空有。\n雪林槁枯者，坐石听亦久。\n还疑紫磨身，成居灵运後。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45628.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45628","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}